            "label": "ponder.starrailexpress.label.vision",
            "lines": [
              {
                "en_us": "- Nuclear Heat \"Nuclear Fusion\": release a 4-block-radius radiation attack (up to 6 people, including Killers); you also glow; players hit by radiation are highlighted for 15s and die if they don't drink water or stand under a shower head within 15s. 120s cooldown.",
                "zh_cn": "- 核热「Nuclear Fusion」: 释放半径4格的辐射攻击（最多6人，包括杀手），自己也会发光，被辐射攻击到的玩家会被高亮15s，若15s内未能喝水或在淋浴头下方则死亡。冷却120s。",
                "zh_tw": "- 核熱「Nuclear Fusion」: 釋放半徑4格的輻射攻擊（最多6人，包括殺手），自己也會發光，被輻射攻擊到的玩家會被高亮15s，若15s內未能喝水或在淋浴頭下方則死亡。冷卻120s。"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
